  "description": "Revision month July, reference 2024-Q2 = 145,17, current 2025-Q2 = 146,68 (illustrative index values, not a reference). July is billed at the old rent; the revision applies from August with no retroactive line (Q-13). L3B: the same lease with a synthetic +4,70 % index under a national cap of 3,5 % on the IRL variation (irl_cap, modelled on the 2022–2024 bouclier, loi 2022-1158 art. 12, re-dated for the test). L3C: an asset in a controlled zone whose ceiling (synthetic 20,00 €/m² × 35,20 m² = 704,00 €) bites; L3 is the same asset outside a controlled zone. L3N: a new lease at 705,00 € on the controlled asset breaks the ceiling (704,00 €) but not the relocation rule (700,00 € × 146,68/145,17 = 707,28 €). L3R: a new lease at 703,00 € meets the ceiling but breaks the relocation rule (680,00 € × 146,68/145,17 = 687,07 €). L3F: revision claimed more than 12 months after the anniversary, forfeited.",
